<title>MEXICO: Sanluis to pay dividend on May 15.</title>
<headline>Sanluis to pay dividend on May 15.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican autoparts and mining company Sanluis Corporacion (Sanluis) will pay a cash dividend as of May 15, the company said in report to the Mexican Stock Exchange on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Sanluis said it will pay a dividend of 0.22 pesos for each A class share held, and 0.726 pesos for each CPO share, upon presentation of coupon number five.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9562))</p>
